00:34:41.946 --> 00:34:43.114
like a Taiwanese buffet –

00:34:43.114 --> 00:34:45.616
you never know how much it will ultimately cost .

00:34:45.616 --> 00:34:47.018
Behind them, they were cooking instant noodles. Hey,

00:34:47.018 --> 00:34:49.487
behind them was their own pot for cooking instant noodles.

00:34:49.487 --> 00:34:50.822
Then they looked on with a shocked expression,

00:34:50.822 --> 00:34:51.589
wondering if

00:34:51.589 --> 00:34:52.857
this guy was some

00:34:52.857 --> 00:34:54.025
Taiwanese celebrity.

00:34:58.162 --> 00:35:00.231
You know, at Taiwanese buffets, you just pick up food

00:35:00.231 --> 00:35:01.799
and don't even know how much you've spent.

00:35:01.799 --> 00:35:03.000
Then the

00:35:03.000 --> 00:35:04.502
Taiwanese lady will use her mood

00:35:04.502 --> 00:35:05.770
to calculate

00:35:05.770 --> 00:35:07.105
your bill randomly.

00:35:09.440 --> 00:35:10.208
There were vegetables.

00:35:10.208 --> 00:35:11.476
Vegetables are precious in Korea

00:35:11.476 --> 00:35:13.244
because they're mostly kimchi;

00:35:13.244 --> 00:35:15.279
you rarely get stir-fried vegetables.

00:35:15.279 --> 00:35:17.515
But it's still kimchi;

00:35:18.282 --> 00:35:20.318
every meal has some kimchi

00:35:20.318 --> 00:35:21.252
salad.

00:35:22.487 --> 00:35:23.955
Now I know why

00:35:23.955 --> 00:35:26.257
in that Korean drama with Kim Jong-un,

00:35:26.257 --> 00:35:28.092
there was nothing left at the end—because

00:35:28.092 --> 00:35:30.261
the staff cafeteria was all-you-can-eat! The

00:35:34.198 --> 00:35:35.700
bean sprout soup

00:35:35.700 --> 00:35:37.568
from the Korean staff meal

00:35:37.568 --> 00:35:38.970
looks delicious!

00:35:38.970 --> 00:35:40.404
We really travel all over the world

00:35:40.404 --> 00:35:42.740
eating at different staff restaurants.

00:35:42.740 --> 00:35:44.475
Does Korea have a Korean way of starting a meal?

00:35:44.475 --> 00:35:45.943
I'm going to eat!

00:35:45.943 --> 00:35:46.777
I'm going to eat!

00:35:47.712 --> 00:35:50.214
I'm going to eat! All

